[{"answer":"My grandparents are coming to visit us from Calgary, Alberta.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/1.mp3"},{"answer":"My father is very happy because they are his parents,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and he's glad that he will see them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/3.mp3"},{"answer":"We don't see them very often because Calgary is a long way from Toronto.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/4-2023-09-01-09-35-33.mp3"},{"answer":"My grandparents have two sons:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/6.mp3"},{"answer":"my father and my Uncle Bill.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Uncle Bill is married to my Aunt Susan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/8.mp3"},{"answer":"They have a daughter who is my cousin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/9.mp3"},{"answer":"My cousin is a lot older than I,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/10.mp3"},{"answer":"so we do not have a lot in common.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/11.mp3"},{"answer":"They also have a son who is the same age as me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/12.mp3"},{"answer":"He is my favorite cousin","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/13.mp3"},{"answer":"because we both like the same television shows","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/14.mp3"},{"answer":"and the same games.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I have two brothers and one sister.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/16.mp3"},{"answer":"My brothers are both younger than I.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/17.mp3"},{"answer":"They are twins, so they have the same birthday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/18.mp3"},{"answer":"My sister is one year older than I.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/19.mp3"},{"answer":"People say that my sister and I look alike.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/20.mp3"},{"answer":"We both have blonde hair and blue eyes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/21.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother's parents live near us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/22.mp3"},{"answer":"They are my grandmother and grandfather who visit us often.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/23.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother does not have any brothers or sisters.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/24.mp3"},{"answer":"She is an only child.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I like it when all my family is together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't have a lot of cousins like some people do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/27.mp3"},{"answer":"but I have fun with my relatives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/28.mp3"},{"answer":"My uncle will often take my cousin and me to the movies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I like to take my grandparents for walks","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/30.mp3"},{"answer":"so they can see my school, and they can meet my friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/31.mp3"},{"answer":"My parents talk to my brothers and my sister and I a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/32.mp3"},{"answer":"We are a very close-knit family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/33.mp3"},{"answer":"People who have close families are very lucky.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/72-my-family-2019-03-29-12-47-52/34.mp3"}]
